# US Journal ERP — Environment Variables

## Local Development (SQLite)
```
DATABASE_URL=file:./db/custom.db
```

## Vercel Deployment (PostgreSQL)
Set these in your Vercel project settings:

```
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://username:password@host:port/database
```

Use one of these PostgreSQL providers:
- **Neon** (free tier): https://neon.tech
- **Supabase** (free tier): https://supabase.com
- **Railway** (free tier): https://railway.app
- **PlanetScale** (paid): https://planetscale.com

## Environment Variable Setup on Vercel
1. Go to your project on Vercel
2. Settings → Environment Variables
3. Add `DATABASE_URL` with your PostgreSQL connection string
4. Redeploy

## Desktop Build
```
DATABASE_URL=file:./db/custom.db
DEPLOY_TARGET=electron
```
